{
  "about": "The daily Sefer Chofetz Chaim luach: three cycles a year by Hebrew month and day, one table for a common year and one for a leap year. Transcribed from chofetzChaimBase.js of @hebcal/learning 6.13.1 (https://github.com/hebcal/hebcal-learning), read as text. An entry names a part of the book and a range: preface, opening, negative, positive, curses and illustrations by paragraph (or illustration), lashonHara and rechilut by principle.se'if, a range that starts at a principle's first se'if reading its opening comments first; a part with no range is read whole. Read by scripts/halacha/build.js; never edited by hand without a correction entry.",
